# ====================
# Dependencies
# ====================
# All three requirement sets are tracked. requirements-ml.txt and
# requirements-dev.txt were ignored here for a period; CI is a clean clone and
# cannot install what is not in the repository, so the suite could not run and
# "the tests pass" was a claim only reproducible on one machine. They hold
# pinned public package names -- nothing environment-specific, nothing secret.

