*.joblib

# The two production artifacts are the exception: without them ATSPredictor
# returns False, Agent 3 falls back to rule-based, and the hybrid ML scoring
# this project advertises does not run at all for anyone who clones it.
# They are a logistic regression plus a feature encoder — small enough to
# track, and the repo is not useful without them.
#
# Listed by name rather than as `!models/production/*.joblib`. Both forms work
# (the rules above match files, not the directory, so the negation is not
# inert the way the docs/ one was). The explicit list is an allowlist: a stray
# experiment artifact dropped into models/production/ stays ignored instead of
# being committed by accident.
!models/production/ats_model.joblib
!models/production/feature_engineer.joblib

